  "prefLabel": "Crv 103.04 Meetings of the Commission",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Crv 103.04 Meetings of the Commission.\n\n(a) The commission holds regular meetings each month.\n\n(b) The commission chair calls special commission meetings as needed or at the written request of three members.\n\nSource. #7567, eff 9-28-01",
